@startuml
title Home Page - sequence diagram
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #888888
  ParticipantBorderColor #444444
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

actor User
participant HomeView #EADCFF
participant catalogService #EADCFF
participant PublicCatalogController #D8F3DC
participant CatalogService #DCECFF
participant ProductRepository #FFF1C9
participant PublicShopController #D8F3DC
participant NotificationController #D8F3DC
participant NotificationService #DCECFF
database MySQL

User -> HomeView : open "/" after login
HomeView -> catalogService : browse(q, category, sort, page)
catalogService -> PublicCatalogController : GET /api/public/products
PublicCatalogController -> CatalogService : browse(q, categoryId, shopId, sort, page, size)
CatalogService -> ProductRepository : find active products
ProductRepository -> MySQL : SELECT Products
MySQL --> ProductRepository : rows
CatalogService --> PublicCatalogController : Results(ProductCard list)
PublicCatalogController --> HomeView : JSON page of products
HomeView -> PublicShopController : GET /api/public/shops?q=
PublicShopController -> MySQL : search Shops by name
PublicShopController --> HomeView : List<ShopCard>
HomeView -> NotificationController : GET /api/account/notifications/unread-count
NotificationController -> NotificationService : unreadCount(userId)
NotificationService -> MySQL : count unread Notifications
NotificationController --> HomeView : unread count
HomeView --> User : hero, products and shops tabs, bell badge

@enduml
